      "usage": {
        "purpose": "把已有汇率JSON转成有基准币种、日期和过滤范围的输入，供方法/工作流复用。",
        "inputs": "三选一：{source_ref:<sources_fetch返回的完整ref>}，或{json_content:<完整文本>}，或{file_path:<包内相对样本路径>}；其余筛选参数按Schema。source_ref由插件按字节分页读取；不要把20000字符预览或data_read工作区路径代替原文。inline输入上限2MiB UTF-8；source_ref原始字节上限2MiB，按原编码解码后上限8MiB UTF-8。",
        "outputs": "JSON返回provider/base/date/total_currencies/returned_currencies/rates；XML返回date/bulletin_no/total_currencies/returned_currencies/currencies（code,name,unit,forex_buying,forex_selling）。两者都有source/version。支持旧base/date和官方Open Access的base_code/time_last_update_utc，不把获取时间替代数据日期。 source_ref输入自动返回source_ref、source_provenance（原最终URL、获取时间、原始字节hash、内容类型、编码）；source为最终URL。inline/包内输入的source仅为inline/包内文件名，不推断URL或抓取时间。 超过24KiB的解析结果不直接注入上下文：返回output_truncated:true、result_ref、result_entries、result_bytes及有界预览；HTML保留完整text_length，RSS保留entry_count/returned_entries，汇率保留total_currencies/returned_currencies。完整结构在result_entries.structured（rows.json，含一行完整结果和来源），HTML全文另在result_entries.text（text.txt）。用host.resources.read(result_ref,{part:\"content\",entry:result_entries.text??result_entries.structured,offset:0,length:8192,encoding:\"utf8\"})按需读取，继续使用返回的nextOffset；Agent工具形状为host_resources_read({ref:result_ref,part:\"content\",entry:result_entries.structured,offset:0,length:8192,encoding:\"utf8\"})。HTML正文可改用返回的result_entries.text；RSS/汇率没有text.txt。预览不能当全文，长结果省略text/entries/rates/currencies；小结果保持完整原字段。",
        "prerequisites": [
          "Existing Python 3 executable (host pythonPath, otherwise python on Windows / python3 on Linux). Only standard-library modules are used; no API key, pip install or network is required for parsing.",
          "host.resources.read resolves source_ref and host.process.exec runs the bundled parser using owned temporary files.",
          "host.resources.create/publish/remove retain large parsed results as immutable data artifacts; no extra Agent tool is needed."
        ],
        "limitations": [
          "仅解释提供的JSON结构；样本是历史固定数据，不是当前报价。",
          "保留base、过滤范围和来源时点；解析结果是原证据的派生结构，不是独立佐证或报告。",
          "仅解析传入快照；原来源选择、取证权限和收费/登录限制由获取能力处理。XML条目和汇率不代表实时价格，保留原始日期与覆盖范围。"
        ],
        "examples": [
          {
            "input": {
              "file_path": "sample_fx.json",
              "codes": [
                "EUR",
                "JPY",
                "GBP",
                "CNY"
              ]
            },
            "output": {
              "format": "exchangerate-json",
              "provider": "https://www.exchangerate-api.com",
              "base": "USD",
              "date": "2026-10-03",
              "total_currencies": 166,
              "returned_currencies": 4,
              "rates": {
                "EUR": 0.889,
                "JPY": 157.82,
                "GBP": 0.756,
                "CNY": 6.71
              },
              "source": "sample_fx.json",
              "version": "3.0.0"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "requires": [
        {
          "id": "python-process",
          "capability": "host.process.exec",
          "reason": "Run the bundled standard-library Python parser through the existing host process capability."
        }
      ]
    },
